    'This tool downloads a workbook from Aspose.Cells storage, optionally converting it to a selected format and applying various export options.  \n\n- **name**: path‑parameter, string, required – the exact filename of the workbook to retrieve.  \n- **format**: query‑parameter, string, optional – the desired conversion format; must be one of CSV, XLS, HTML, MHTML, ODS, PDF, XML, TXT, TIFF, XLSB, XLSM, XLSX, XLTM, XLTX, XPS, PNG, JPG, JPEG, GIF, EMF, BMP, MD (Markdown), or Numbers.  \n- **password**: query‑parameter, string, optional – password needed to open a protected Excel file.  \n- **isAutoFit**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to set workbook rows to autofit, false to leave sizes unchanged.  \n- **onlySaveTable**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to save only table data (applicable when converting PDF to Excel).  \n- **folder**: query‑parameter, string, optional – folder path in the storage where the source file resides.  \n- **outPath**: query‑parameter, string, optional – for a single output file, the full path including filename and extension; for multiple files, the folder path where results should be placed.  \n- **storageName**: query‑parameter, string, optional – name of the storage containing the source workbook.  \n- **outStorageName**: query‑parameter, string, optional – name of the storage where the converted file(s) should be saved.  \n- **checkExcelRestriction**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to enforce Excel restrictions when modifying cell‑related objects.  \n- **region**: query‑parameter, string, optional – regional settings identifier to apply to the workbook.  \n- **pageWideFitOnPerSheet**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to fit page width on each worksheet during conversion.  \n- **pageTallFitOnPerSheet**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to fit page height on each worksheet during conversion.  \n- **onePagePerSheet**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to generate one PDF page per worksheet when the output format is PDF.  \n- **onlyAutofitTable**: query‑parameter, boolean, optional – true to autofit only tables in the workbook.  \n\nThe output is the requested workbook delivered as a binary file (or set of files) in the response body, encoded in the specified format and reflecting any options that were applied.'
